flowchart TD
    FileName[Sample file name]
    ParserChoice{Fixture parser}
    LlamaFixture[Hard-coded LlamaParse-style elements]
    UnstructuredFixture[Hard-coded Unstructured-style elements]

    FileName --> ParserChoice
    ParserChoice --> LlamaFixture
    ParserChoice --> UnstructuredFixture

    LlamaFixture --> Elements[Typed elements]
    UnstructuredFixture --> Elements
    Elements --> Type{Element type}
    Type -->|Table| TableChunk[Markdown table chunk]
    Type -->|Image| ImageChunk[Image reference and caption]
    Type -->|List| ListChunk[Nested-list chunk]
    Type -->|Text or title| TextBuffer[Buffered text chunk]

    TableChunk --> Chunks[Chunks with metadata]
    ImageChunk --> Chunks
    ListChunk --> Chunks
    TextBuffer --> Chunks

    Query[Query] --> QueryEmbed[SentenceTransformer embedding]
    Chunks --> ChunkEmbed[Chunk embeddings]
    QueryEmbed --> Score[Cosine similarity]
    ChunkEmbed --> Score
    Score --> Rule[Optional 20 percent table boost]
    Rule --> Results[Top-k chunks]

    note1[Parser calls are simulated; no PDF or DOCX is opened]
    note1 -.-> ParserChoice
